Manage Slack configuration

Usage: qam slack [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  set   Store Slack credentials in config
  test  Test Slack upload with a file
  help  Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --config <path>  Path to config file (default: $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/camsnap/config.yaml)
  -h, --help           Print help
